 ORIGINAL OLMS
 Peter Rocca's OLMS (Offline Mail System, Version 2000) was the
 inspiration for this project. Peter granted permission to create
 this clean-room reimplementation under GPLv3. No original source
 code was used. All record layouts were reverse-engineered from
 published data files and documentation.

